{"parse": {"title": "翡翠石板", "pageid": 96877, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"翡翠石板\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Item-110904.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"翡翠石板\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>翡翠石板</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#110904</div></div><hr /><div>字字如絮语，字字箴言。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">“分土于火，萃精于糙，谨慎行之。”</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110903\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%BC%86%E6%B3%A5%E6%9D%BF\" title=\"红漆泥板\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%BC%86%E6%B3%A5%E6%9D%BF\" title=\"红漆泥板\"><img alt=\"红漆泥板\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110903.png/100px-Item-110903.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110903.png/150px-Item-110903.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Item-110903.png/200px-Item-110903.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%A2%E6%BC%86%E6%B3%A5%E6%9D%BF\" title=\"红漆泥板\">红漆泥板</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">泥板本不必待遇如此，但是谁让它被祝福过？用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×3</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/110603\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BF%BC%E9%80%A0%E9%97%A8%E5%8C%99\" title=\"翼造门匙\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BF%BC%E9%80%A0%E9%97%A8%E5%8C%99\" title=\"翼造门匙\"><img alt=\"翼造门匙\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/Item-110603.png/100px-Item-110603.png\" decoding=\"async\